      "year": 2006,
      "text": "Given two arrays of numbers $a _ { 1 }, \\ldots, a _ { n }$ and $b _ { 1 }, \\ldots, b _ { n }$ where each number is or, the fastest algorithm to find the largest span such that $a _ { i } + a _ { i + 1 } + \\cdots + a _ { j } = b _ { i } + b _ { i + 1 } + \\cdots + b _ { j }$ or report that there is not such span,",
